{"seq":2,"slug":"epr-reporting-fee-settlement","title":"EPR 申报与费用结算机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-compliance-cost/epr-reporting-fee-settlement","wordCount":2824,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"epr-申报与费用结算机制\">EPR 申报与费用结算机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-从-投放量申报-到-pro-账单-的闭环\">核心概念：从「投放量申报」到「PRO 账单」的闭环</h2><p>对跨境卖家而言，EPR 合规真正的经济后果出现在账单那一刻：你按什么口径申报、PRO 按什么费率计价、回收凭证能抵扣多少、年终清算抽回还是退还——这四步决定了一个 SKU 在欧洲的真实合规成本。把一个 200 克的蓝牙音箱投放到德国市场，它触发的不是一笔固定费用，而是一条**「申报 → 计价 → 结算 → 稽核」的闭环链路**，每一环都由法规和一个生产者责任组织（PRO, Producer Responsibility Organisation）的费率表共同定义。</p>\n<p>这条链路的法定骨架是欧盟 WEEE 指令 <strong>2012/19/EU</strong>（经指令 (EU) 2018/849 修订）。它把「投放市场」定义为义务起点，要求成员国建立登记册与生产者责任制度。但指令只规定<strong>义务结构</strong>，不规定<strong>具体申报口径与费率</strong>——真正的口径由三类下层规则拼成：欧盟实施条例 <strong>2017/699</strong> 规定「投放市场 EEE 重量」与「WEEE 生成量」的统一计算方法；实施条例 <strong>2019/2193</strong> 规定了成员国向欧委会报送数据的格式与质量规则；成员国国内法则（德国 ElektroG、法国 AGEC 法 2020-105 等）把申报周期、登记机关和 PRO 体系落到本地。</p>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的点：<strong>申报的不是「卖了多少台」，而是「按品类折算后的重量」</strong>。同一款音箱放在德国计费按「品类 5 小型设备」的重量，放在法国按 ecosystem 细分品类，放在荷兰按 Stichting OPEN 的 tariff——三张费率表品类划分、单价与调节系数各不相同。这解释了为什么同一批货在不同国家 EPR 成本能差出数倍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[投放市场 POM&lt;br/&gt;按品类申报重量] --&gt; B[法域登记/申报&lt;br/&gt;ear / SYDEREP / 国家登记册]&#10;    B --&gt; C[PRO 费率表&lt;br/&gt;品类单价 × 重量]&#10;    C --&gt; D{生态调节系数&lt;br/&gt;eco-modulation}&#10;    D --&gt; E[应付费用&lt;br/&gt;预缴/年度账单]&#10;    F[回收凭证&lt;br/&gt;evidence notes] --&gt; G[凭证核销抵扣]&#10;    E --&gt; H[年终清算&lt;br/&gt;补缴 or 退还]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[稽核与申报核查&lt;br/&gt;2019/2193 数据规则]\">graph TD\n    A[投放市场 POM&lt;br/&gt;按品类申报重量] --&gt; B[法域登记/申报&lt;br/&gt;ear / SYDEREP / 国家登记册]\n    B --&gt; C[PRO 费率表&lt;br/&gt;品类单价 × 重量]\n    C --&gt; D{生态调节系数&lt;br/&gt;eco-modulation}\n    D --&gt; E[应付费用&lt;br/&gt;预缴/年度账单]\n    F[回收凭证&lt;br/&gt;evidence notes] --&gt; G[凭证核销抵扣]\n    E --&gt; H[年终清算&lt;br/&gt;补缴 or 退还]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[稽核与申报核查&lt;br/&gt;2019/2193 数据规则]</pre><h2 id=\"申报口径与申报周期-pom-重量-品类映射与三张报表\">申报口径与申报周期：POM 重量、品类映射与三张报表</h2><p>申报的错误几乎都发生在<strong>口径</strong>而不是算术：把「净重」写成「毛重」、把「品类 2 屏幕」错映射成「品类 4 大型设备」、把跨境 B2B 批发漏算成 B2C 零售——任何一项都会让后续所有结算数字失准。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步是把产品映射到法域品类。</strong> WEEE 指令附录 I/II 定义六大品类（后并入 2018 年起的「开放式范围」分类），但成员国会在其下细分。德国 ear 系统按「设备类型 + 品类」登记；法国 ecosystem 使用更细的品类树，与 ADEME 的 SYDEREP 注册平台绑定；荷兰 Stichting OPEN 则按「灯具 / 小型设备 / 大件 / 显示设备」等简化分组。跨境卖家必须在每个法域独立完成一次映射，不能复用别国的品类代码。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步是确定申报周期。</strong> 欧洲主要法域普遍采用<strong>月度申报 + 年度汇总</strong>的双层结构：月度申报反映当期投放量（用于预缴），年度报表是最终结算基准。德国 ElektroG 下生产者须按月向 ear 申报投放量、按年提交报告；单据以重量（公斤）为单位、按品类分列。意大利、西班牙等国的 PRO 体系（如 WEEE 协调中心）同样要求定期申报，周期因国而异。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步是处理三类不同的报表</strong>，它们对应不同的分母：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>报表</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母 / 参照</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>投放量申报</strong>（POM）</td>\n<td>当期投放市场的 EEE 重量</td>\n<td>无（绝对量）</td>\n<td>计费基数、登记册更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>收集与处理报告</strong></td>\n<td>收上来的 WEEE 重量</td>\n<td>投放量</td>\n<td>法域收集率达标判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>再循环/回收报告</strong></td>\n<td>再循环产出重量</td>\n<td>进入处理线重量</td>\n<td>附录 V 达标 + 凭证核销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对卖家而言真正触发付款的是第一张表；后两张表由 PRO 或处理商汇总，反过来决定 PRO 的<strong>成本</strong>，进而决定下一年的费率。所以「我申报准确」不等于「我成本可控」——真实的成本杠杆在于品类映射的准确度和生态调节系数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费率结构与生态调节-重量费率-eco-modulation-系数与奖金罚款\">费率结构与生态调节：重量费率、eco-modulation 系数与奖金罚款</h2><p>EPR 费用的基础形态是<strong>重量费率</strong>：应付费用 = 某品类重量 × 该品类单价。但 2020 年后欧洲普遍叠加了第二层——<strong>生态调节（eco-modulation / éco-modulation）</strong>，即按产品的可回收性、可修复性、有害物质含量或再生料比例，对基础费率做加价（malus）或减价（bonus）。</p>\n<p>法国是这一机制的样板。AGEC 法（Loi n° 2020-105, 2020-02-10）要求自 2022 年 1 月 1 日起，EEE、家具、纺织等品类的 EPR 费率必须包含生态调节分项，其设计由各品类 éco-organisme（EEE 领域为 ecosystem）提出、经主管部门批准。法国还把**可修复性指数（indice de réparabilité）**接入费率：分数越高，同重量产品的费率越低。这一机制的直接后果是——<strong>同一品类的两个 SKU，因设计不同可能落到不同的单价档</strong>。</p>\n<p>费用的一般表达式可写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = \\sum_{c \\in C} \\left( w_c \\cdot r_c \\cdot (1 + m_c) - e_c \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为品类集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该品类申报重量（kg），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为基础重量费率（€/kg），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为生态调节系数（加价为正、减价为负），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为凭证核销或减免额。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常是一个<strong>分段函数</strong>，按可回收性等级或有害物质类别取值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调节维度</th>\n<th>典型做法</th>\n<th>费率方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有害物质超标（如某些阻燃剂）</td>\n<td>加收处理附加费</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未做可回收设计 / 复合材料难拆解</td>\n<td>基础档以上加价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可修复性指数高 / 模块化设计</td>\n<td>减价奖励</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用再生塑料达阈值</td>\n<td>减价奖励</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小型生产者豁免（年投放量低于阈值）</td>\n<td>免除部分义务</td>\n<td>部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要特别警惕<strong>跨境双向适用</strong>：如果你的产品从欧盟外进口、在欧盟内多国销售，你可能同时在多国被计费；而你如果既做投放又做回收，某些法域（如法国部分品类、荷兰部分体系）允许用<strong>回收凭证</strong>抵扣应付费用，即上式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项。凭证抵扣不是自动的，需要主动申报并附处理商证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算流程-预缴-回收凭证核销与年终清算\">结算流程：预缴、回收凭证核销与年终清算</h2><p>申报与最终付款之间隔着<strong>结算机制</strong>，它是跨境卖家现金流最容易失控的环节。典型流程是「<strong>预估预缴 → 定期申报调账 → 年终清算</strong>」三段式：</p>\n<p><strong>预缴（advance payment）</strong> 基于上一年度申报量或当年首期预测，PRO 要求按季或按月支付。德国、法国、荷兰的 PRO 普遍在第一年新注册时要求预估年投放量并按此预缴，避免年末一次性大额账单。</p>\n<p><strong>周期申报调账</strong> 用当期真实投放量修正预缴基数。若实际高于预估，差额补缴；低于预估则形成贷项，通常不直接退款而是冲抵后续账期。</p>\n<p><strong>年终清算（annual reconciliation）</strong> 是最终结算：以年度报表的 POM 重量为基准，加上生态调节修正，减去已核销凭证，得出年度应付总额与已缴总额之差。差额方向决定卖家是补缴还是收到退款。这里有一处合同细节极易被忽略：<strong>多数 PRO 的会员协议允许对「申报不实的差额」追溯追缴并加收利息或罚金</strong>，追溯期通常覆盖数个申报年度。</p>\n<p>跨境 B2C 远程销售还有一个特殊结算点：<strong>平台代扣代缴与授权代表结算</strong>。当卖家在欧盟无常设机构时，义务通常由**授权代表（authorised representative）**或平台承担申报结算，费用通过授权代表服务费 + PRO 实际账单两层叠加。这也是为什么「注册号」和「结算主体」必须一致——注册在一个主体、结算走另一个主体，稽核时会被认定为申报链断裂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境卖家的结算实操与稽核风险\">跨境卖家的结算实操与稽核风险</h2><p>把上面的机制落到日常操作，跨境卖家最常踩的坑集中在四处：</p>\n<p><strong>品类映射漂移。</strong> 产品迭代后（例如把分体式改成一体式、把塑料壳改成金属壳）品类或可回收性等级可能变化，但卖家仍沿用旧申报口径。这在生态调节体系下意味着持续少缴或多缴，年终清算或稽核时集中暴露。</p>\n<p><strong>重量口径不一。</strong> 计费重量应以法规或 PRO 定义的「投放市场 EEE 重量」为准（实施条例 2017/699 定义了统一计算口径），而非包装毛重或物流计费重。用错口径会导致系统性偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>凭证核销未做。</strong> 有回收能力或通过处理商取得 evidence notes 的卖家，如果不在申报期内提交核销，等于放弃减免费用的权利。</p>\n<p><strong>登记-申报-结算主体分离。</strong> 授权代表注册、实际投放主体、付款主体不一致时，稽核风险最高。部分平台（如亚马逊在德国、法国等站点的 EPR 合规要求）会核验注册号与商品，一旦断链直接下架。</p>\n<p>从成本管理角度看，EPR 结算应被当作一条<strong>可测算的产品线成本</strong>而非一次性行政支出：给定品类、重量、生态调节档位和所在法域，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是可建模、可预算、可优化（通过改设计降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、通过回收抵扣降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项）的。把这条链路做成系统里的一个字段级模型，比事后追账单划算得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>EPR 结算是一条闭环：<strong>投放量申报 → PRO 费率计价 → 生态调节修正 → 凭证核销 → 年终清算</strong>，每一环由指令 2012/19/EU 的骨架加成员国国内法与 PRO 费率表共同定义。</li>\n<li>申报口径不是「卖了几台」而是「按法域品类折算的重量」，欧盟实施条例 <strong>2017/699</strong>（POM/生成量计算方法）与 <strong>2019/2193</strong>（数据报告规则）是底层口径依据。</li>\n<li>费用表达式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = \\sum_c (w_c \\cdot r_c \\cdot (1+m_c) - e_c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：重量费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基础，生态调节系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与凭证核销 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是真正的成本杠杆。</li>\n<li>法国 AGEC 法（2020-105）自 2022 年起强制生态调节，把<strong>可修复性指数</strong>接入费率，使同品类不同 SKU 落到不同单价档。</li>\n<li>结算采用「预估预缴 → 周期申报调账 → 年终清算」三段式；申报不实的差额多数 PRO 协议保留追溯追缴权。</li>\n<li>跨境卖家四大风险：品类映射漂移、重量口径错误、凭证核销遗漏、登记-申报-结算主体分离（导致平台核验断链下架）。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>与本章其他文档的关系：法域登记与授权代表的落地流程见同章《<a href=\"../endoflife-obligation-subject/epr-registration-authorized-representative\">EPR 注册与授权代表机制</a>》；计费所需的回收率与处置数据核算方法见《<a href=\"../treatment-recycling-data/recycling-rate-data-accounting\">回收率与处置数据核算方法</a>》。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"EPR 申报与费用结算机制","id":"epr-申报与费用结算机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从「投放量申报」到「PRO 账单」的闭环","id":"核心概念-从-投放量申报-到-pro-账单-的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"申报口径与申报周期：POM 重量、品类映射与三张报表","id":"申报口径与申报周期-pom-重量-品类映射与三张报表"},{"level":2,"text":"费率结构与生态调节：重量费率、eco-modulation 系数与奖金罚款","id":"费率结构与生态调节-重量费率-eco-modulation-系数与奖金罚款"},{"level":2,"text":"结算流程：预缴、回收凭证核销与年终清算","id":"结算流程-预缴-回收凭证核销与年终清算"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境卖家的结算实操与稽核风险","id":"跨境卖家的结算实操与稽核风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WEEE/EPR 合规成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-compliance-cost/compliance-cost-model"},"next":{"title":"合规审计与违规风险处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-compliance-cost/compliance-audit-violation-risk"}}